From 84e48a98a5cb548388d685bb2c96248af8afb71e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:37:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: refresh EasyList cache with conditional GET

Keep serving compiled.json while checking for updates every 24h, skip
recompile on HTTP 304, and retry failed fetches after a backoff instead
of wiping the on-disk cache.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
